        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates take great pleasure in presenting no. 10 Montpellier Hill, a 3 storey period residence with a large rear garden. Number 10 appears 2 storey from the front but is set over 3 floors with the living and kitchen areas set in the vaulted ceiling top floor. Number 10 Montpellier Hill is sure to appeal to those looking for a unique home of immense character in a cityside location with the Phoenix Park on its doorstep. \r\n\r\nIdeally positioned minutes' walk of village of Stoneybatter and nearby Smithfield village, one of the main attractions of the area is the fabulous Phoenix Park which is a few minutes' walk away. For those working in the city centre it is a pleasant stroll, with public transport also available at Heuston Station and the LUAS stop 5 minutes’ walk at The National Museum. Ample bus routes have stops on the North Circular Road while the M50 allows easy access to the Airport. TUD campus at Grangegorman are all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, Living room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and a shower room.  Large south facing rear garden with patio and raised bedding.  Viewing is very highly recommended!\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hall\t\tWooden flooring\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.71m x 4.62m\tWooden flooring and whb.\r\nGarden Level\t\t\r\nBedroom 2)\t4.63m x 3.54m\tWhb\r\nShower Room\t\tShower, WC and whb\r\n1st Floor\r\nLiving Room\t\r\n4.36m x 3.73m\t\r\nWooden floor, open fireplace, feature vaulted ceiling with ‘Velux’ window and spot lighting.\r\nKitchen\t2.00m x 2.00m\tWall and floor mounted units, ‘Velux’ window and spot lighting.\r\nOutside\t\tLarge south facing rear garden with patio and raised bedding.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features\r\n\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows\r\n•\tLarge south facing garden\r\n•\tG.F.C.H.\r\n•\tBER D 2 \r\n•\tClose to Smithfield & Stoneybatter\r\n•\tPhoenix Park on the doorstep\t\r\n•\tWell serviced by local transport links\r\n•\tSchools, shops and businesses on the doorstep\r\n•\t2 large double bedrooms\r\n•\tLUAS 5 minute walk\r\n•\tClose to Collins Barracks\r\n•\tBeside River Liffey\r\n\r\nNegotiator:\tPaul Lappin Office:  01 8825730   \r\n\r\nViewing:\tViewing by appointment with Property Team Lappin Estates \r\n\r\nCALL 01 8825730 TO HAVE YOUR HOME VALUED FOR FREE"
      },
